node1533 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>lei</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/lei' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/lei</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;The Legal Entity Identifier (LEI) &lt;https://www.gleif.org/en/organizational-identity/introducing-the-legal-entity-identifier-lei&gt; is a 20-character, alphanumeric code based on the ISO 17442 &lt;https://www.iso.org/standard/78829.html&gt; standard developed by the International Organization for Standardization.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;The Legal Entity Identifier (LEI) &lt;https://www.gleif.org/en/organizational-identity/introducing-the-legal-entity-identifier-lei&gt; is a 20-character, alphanumeric code based on the ISO 17442 &lt;https://www.iso.org/standard/78829.html&gt; standard developed by the International Organization for Standardization.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
