could be used during the inference.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;Notes if sensitive personal information is used in the training or inference of
the AI models.

This can include biometric data, addresses or other data that can be used to
infer a person&#x27;s identity.

Related: hasSensitivePersonalInformation in /Dataset/DatasetPackage&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
